sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client (gateway)
  participant O as order-service (orchestrator)
  participant U as user-service
  participant K as catalog-service
  participant P as payment-service
  participant Q as Kafka / Pub/Sub
  C->>O: POST /orders
  O->>U: GET /users/{id} (REST)
  O->>O: INSERT order PENDING (local tx)
  O->>K: ReserveStock(order_id, items) (gRPC)
  alt insufficient stock
    K-->>O: success=false
    O->>O: status = REJECTED (nothing to compensate)
  else reserved
    K-->>O: success=true, total
    O->>P: Charge(order_id, total) (gRPC)
    alt payment declined
      P-->>O: success=false
      O->>K: ReleaseStock(order_id)  [COMPENSATION]
      O->>O: status = CANCELLED
      O-)Q: Kafka order_cancelled
    else charged
      P-->>O: success=true
      O->>O: status = COMPLETED (local tx)
      O-)Q: Kafka order_completed + Pub/Sub order-completed
    end
  end
  O-->>C: order + saga log
